            <div type="edition" xml:space="preserve">
                <ab xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0"><lb n="1"/>ku-po-ro-ko-ra-ti-wo-se | e-mi o la-o<lb n="2"/>o-te | o mo-i po-si-se | o-na-si-ti-mo-se<lb n="3"/>ti-wi-so-ni-ta-se | ti-pa-se | e-mi</ab>
            </div>
            <div type="translation" xml:lang="DE" resp="Klaus Hallof"><ab xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0"><lb n="1"/>Ich, dieser (Grab)Stein hier, bin der Kyprogoratis.<lb n="2"/>Mein Gatte ist Onasitimos<lb n="3"/>S.d. Diwisonidas. Ich bin (Mutter) zweier Kinder.</ab></div><div type="translation" xml:lang="GRC" resp=" "><ab xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0"><lb n="1"/>Κυπρογορατίϝος ἠμὶ ὁ λᾶο(ς)<lb n="2"/>ὅδε· ὅ μοι πόσις Ὀνασίτιμος<lb n="3"/>Διϝισωνίδας(?)· δίπας ἠμί.</ab></div>
            <div type="bibliography">
                <p>Inscriptiones Cypri. Pars I. Inscriptiones Cypri syllabicae. Fasc. 1. Inscriptiones Amathuntis, Curii, Marii. Edid. Artemis Karnava et Massimo Perna adiuvante Markus Egetmeyer. – Berlin 2020</p>
